Package: clinstats
Title: Clinical Research Statistics Toolkit
Version: 0.1.2
Authors@R: c(
    person("Feng", "Gao", email = "gaofeng21cn@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Lina", "Zhu", role = "ctb"),
    person("Wei", "Wang", role = "ctb")
  )
Description: Statistical utilities that recur in clinical and translational
    research workflows: receiver operating characteristic (ROC) summaries,
    odds ratios, univariable and multivariable Cox and logistic regression
    tables, time-dependent survival cut points, resampling-based Cox
    screening, TCGA clinical extraction, and expression-matrix cleaning.
    Includes curated colorectal cancer clinical datasets assembled from
    public repositories, a Quarto report template, and tidy data-frame
    output that is convenient for both interactive and programmatic use.
